{"3937180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadly Sip", "steam_appid": 3937180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎 Deduced the sole truth from a maze of clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, both sides receive fragmented clue cards. Is it wine in the goblet? Or has it been laced with poison? Piece together the scattered information and use logic to steer clear of fatal traps.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥂 Cheers for our suffering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cup and drain it. When the crimson toxin clouds your vision and your heart beats like thunder, can you still maintain your sanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/712d50d7981857b612ccc63d246aeede.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/712d50d7981857b612ccc63d246aeede.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/712d50d7981857b612ccc63d246aeede.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔄 Manipulate the props to turn the tide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the cards in your hand. Use the Analyzer to see through the liquid's disguise, use the Prohibition Order to force your opponent into a minefield of your making, or use a drop of Mandragora to forcibly reverse the toxicity in a desperate situation.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/5a1b2f0d7aaac333083aa5af3a8cbc57.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/5a1b2f0d7aaac333083aa5af3a8cbc57.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/5a1b2f0d7aaac333083aa5af3a8cbc57.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ As the poisoned wine flows down the throat, life flickers like a candle in the wind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only stakes are a few fragile candles. Once the flame is extinguished, your soul will be trapped here forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/562e4d9301c11e289d600de6ce60fd9c.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/562e4d9301c11e289d600de6ce60fd9c.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/562e4d9301c11e289d600de6ce60fd9c.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌿 Life hangs by a thread, yet perhaps a healing cure lies hidden within a single cup</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this gamble of deception and testing, miracles may happen occasionally, but they never favor the coward.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/bf882b20415fe27ee301aa57aa928b79.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/bf882b20415fe27ee301aa57aa928b79.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/bf882b20415fe27ee301aa57aa928b79.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎 Deduced the sole truth from a maze of clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, both sides receive fragmented clue cards. Is it wine in the goblet? Or has it been laced with poison? Piece together the scattered information and use logic to steer clear of fatal traps.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.poster.avif?t=1786780005\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.webm?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937180/extras/e496635f222361538d1424df78de7077.mp4?t=1786780005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥂 Cheers for our suffering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cup and drain it. When the crimson toxin clouds your vision and your heart beats like thunder, can you still maintain 